root	/home/resources/packages/snobol4/spitbol_88
origin	https://github.com/spitbol/88-binary (Catspaw's SPITBOL-88 distribution); in the clone the programs of DEMOS, SANDLP and the root's TEST and TICTAC have their .SPT extension written .spt and their DOS line ends made LF, nothing else changed; CODE.SPT (it runs shell commands) and EXTERNAL (programs that load external functions) keep the name .SPT, which the miner does not read, and are never run
version	1b8a7a6 (2015-06-29); CHANGED IN PLACE 2026-11-17 by officer_09: DEMOS/ATN.spt (15 lines), DEMOS/KEYWORD.spt (2), DEMOS/KWIC1.spt (2) and DEMOS/KWIC2.spt (7) spell an angle-bracket subscript with square brackets, one character for one; DEMOS/atn.in and DEMOS/ATN.IN (line 146 of each, GETF = LEXICAL_FEATURES<X>, the statement ATN.spt hands to CODE) likewise, 2026-11-18 by developer_12, DEMOS/ATN.out re-cut from sbl -bf twice alike; the originals are at the origin; CASE CONVERTED IN PLACE 2026-11-17 by officer_09: SANDLP/BNF.spt (29 lines) upper-cased by sno_upcase_edition.py, one character for one
